          "explanation": "Doctor insists on obtaining the full pathology report with specific keywords before making any decision.",
          "quote": "先把最关键的一张纸——“病理报告全页”补齐"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC2 is fully met: the doctor makes the pathology report the core of the decision, actively queries the workspace, and acknowledges the possible discrepancy in phrasing.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC2_pathology_and_record_verification",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
