          "explanation": "Doctor clearly corrects the misuse of cervical screening and explains the anatomical and methodological difference.",
          "quote": "宫颈筛查阴性只能说明宫颈目前没病变，并不能代表子宫内膜没事"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC3 is fully met: the doctor distinguishes cervical from endometrial screening, places pathology above the negative cervical screen, and does so without blaming the family.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC3_correct_cervical_screening_misinterpretation",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00068",
          "explanation": "Doctor explains that complex atypical hyperplasia is a high-risk precancerous lesion that requires urgent evaluation, not just repeat imaging.",
          "quote": "AEH/EIN 属于“高风险癌前”，几周内处理即可，但流程一旦断开，再排队可能又多等一两周"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC4 is fully met: the doctor identifies the high-risk nature of the pathology and explains why simple tests cannot replace a definitive evaluation.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC4_risk_level_and_timely_pathway",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
